{"path":"filesystem/path/replace_extension","title":"std::filesystem::path::replace_extension","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::filesystem::path::</span>replace_extension","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/filesystem/path/replace_extension","section":"filesystem","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the extension with replacement or removes it when the default value of replacement is used.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> replace_extension<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> replacement <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> path<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the extension with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">replacement</span></code> or removes it when the default value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">replacement</span></code> is used.\n</p><p>Firstly, if this path has an <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path/extension\"><code>extension()</code></a>, it is removed from the generic-format view of the pathname. \n</p><p>Then, a dot character is appended to the generic-format view of the pathname, if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">replacement</span></code> is not empty and does not begin with a dot character.\n</p><p>Then <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">replacement</span></code> is appended as if by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>replacement<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> replacement\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the extension to replace with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The type of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">replacement</span></code> is <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path\">std::filesystem::path</a></span> even though it is not intended to represent an object on the file system in order to correctly account for the filesystem character encoding.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;utility&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> width1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">18</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, width2<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">11</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// columns' width</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/left\"><span class=\"kw1796\">std::<span class=\"me2\">left</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width1<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Path:\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Ext:\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Result:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span>p, e<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair/make_pair\"><span class=\"kw1105\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar.jpg\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar.jpg\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar.jpg\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar.jpg\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar.\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/bar\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/.\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/.\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/.\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/.\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\".png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n            <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/foo/\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"png\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path\"><span class=\"kw2219\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span></span></a> path<span class=\"br0\">{</span>p<span class=\"br0\">}</span>, ext<span class=\"br0\">{</span>e<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width1<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> path <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ext<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        path.<span class=\"me1\">replace_extension</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ext<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> path <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Path:             Ext:       Result:\n\"/foo/bar.jpg\"    \".png\"     \"/foo/bar.png\"\n\"/foo/bar.jpg\"    \"png\"      \"/foo/bar.png\"\n\"/foo/bar.jpg\"    \".\"        \"/foo/bar.\"\n\"/foo/bar.jpg\"    \"\"         \"/foo/bar\"\n\"/foo/bar.\"       \"png\"      \"/foo/bar.png\"\n\"/foo/bar\"        \".png\"     \"/foo/bar.png\"\n\"/foo/bar\"        \"png\"      \"/foo/bar.png\"\n\"/foo/bar\"        \".\"        \"/foo/bar.\"\n\"/foo/bar\"        \"\"         \"/foo/bar\"\n\"/foo/.\"          \".png\"     \"/foo/..png\"\n\"/foo/.\"          \"png\"      \"/foo/..png\"\n\"/foo/.\"          \".\"        \"/foo/..\"\n\"/foo/.\"          \"\"         \"/foo/.\"\n\"/foo/\"           \".png\"     \"/foo/.png\"\n\"/foo/\"           \"png\"      \"/foo/.png\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path/extension\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>extension</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the file extension path component <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path/filename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>filename</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the filename path component <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path/stem\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>stem</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the stem path component (filename without the final extension) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/path/has_path\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>has_extension</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if the corresponding path element is not empty <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"filesystem","title":"Filesystem library (since C++17)"},{"path":"filesystem/path","title":"std::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::filesystem::path::replace_extension","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Replaces the extension with replacement or removes it when the default value of replacement is used."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"replacement"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The type of replacement is std::filesystem::path even though it is not intended to represent an object on the file system in order to correctly account for…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","c